            "frame_00092.png",
            "frame_00093.png",
            "frame_00094.png"
        ],
        "transcript": "So let's talk about why will something begin to rotate or why will something rotating stop?"
    },
    {
        "id": 32,
        "start": 141.36,
        "end": 145.44,
        "frames": [
            "frame_00095.png",
            "frame_00096.png",
            "frame_00097.png",
            "frame_00098.png",
            "frame_00099.png"
        ],
        "transcript": "Let's take the example of a fan, ceiling fan."
    },
    {
        "id": 33,
        "start": 145.44,
        "end": 146.08,
        "frames": [
            "frame_00100.png"
        ],
        "transcript": "Yeah?"
    },
    {
        "id": 34,
        "start": 146.08,
        "end": 148.08,
        "frames": [
            "frame_00101.png",
            "frame_00102.png",
            "frame_00103.png"
