    {
        "id": 35,
        "start": 148.08,
        "end": 149.52,
        "frames": [
            "frame_00104.png"
        ],
        "transcript": "It is off now."
    },
    {
        "id": 36,
        "start": 149.52,
        "end": 153.2,
        "frames": [
            "frame_00105.png",
            "frame_00106.png",
            "frame_00107.png"
        ],
        "transcript": "You turn on the switch, it starts rotating."
    },
    {
        "id": 37,
        "start": 153.2,
        "end": 160.0,
        "frames": [
            "frame_00108.png",
            "frame_00109.png",
            "frame_00110.png",
            "frame_00111.png",
            "frame_00112.png"
        ],
        "transcript": "What was the reason why it started rotating and it increases the speed till it reaches some maximum speed?"
    },
    {
        "id": 38,
        "start": 160.0,
        "end": 166.72,
        "frames": [
            "frame_00113.png",
            "frame_00114.png",
            "frame_00115.png",
            "frame_00116.png",
            "frame_00117.png"
        ],
        "transcript": "And when you turn it off, slowly the speed you know goes away until it comes to a halt."
    },
    {
        "id": 39,
        "start": 166.72,
        "end": 174.64,
        "frames": [
            "frame_00118.png",
            "frame_00119.png",
            "frame_00120.png",
            "frame_00121.png",
            "frame_00122.png"
        ],
        "transcript": "Even a top, you apply a force using your hand, it spins, but after some time it stops."
    },
    {
        "id": 40,
        "start": 174.64,
        "end": 178.88,
        "frames": [
            "frame_00123.png",
            "frame_00124.png"
        ],
        "transcript": "What is the reason for its rotation?"
    },
    {
        "id": 41,
        "start": 178.88,
        "end": 192.0,
        "frames": [
            "frame_00125.png",
            "frame_00126.png",
            "frame_00127.png",
            "frame_00128.png",
            "frame_00129.png",
            "frame_00130.png",
            "frame_00131.png",
            "frame_00132.png",
            "frame_00133.png"
        ],
        "transcript": "The reason for its rotation is because of a physical quantity called as torque, which is the equivalent of force beat inside rotation."
    },
    {
        "id": 42,
        "start": 192.0,
        "end": 204.0,
        "frames": [
            "frame_00134.png",
            "frame_00135.png",
            "frame_00136.png"
        ],
        "transcript": "So why bodies rotate is due to due to a concept called as torque."
    },
    {
        "id": 43,
        "start": 204.0,
        "end": 216.48,
        "frames": [
            "frame_00137.png",
            "frame_00138.png",
            "frame_00139.png",
            "frame_00140.png"
        ],
        "transcript": "The symbol of that physical quantity is a t it is called Greek alphabet, a t with a small curve at the bottom, like a j, but not so big."
    },
    {
        "id": 44,
        "start": 216.48,
        "end": 233.04,
        "frames": [
            "frame_00141.png",
            "frame_00142.png",
            "frame_00143.png",
            "frame_00144.png",
            "frame_00145.png",
            "frame_00146.png",
            "frame_00147.png",
            "frame_00148.png"
        ],
        "transcript": "That is the symbol for torque, and it is nothing but the equivalent of force, equivalent of force in rotation."
    },
    {
        "id": 45,
        "start": 233.04,
        "end": 240.72,
        "frames": [
            "frame_00149.png",
            "frame_00150.png",
            "frame_00151.png",
            "frame_00152.png"
        ],
        "transcript": "So what force does in translation same thing torque does in rotation."
    },
    {
        "id": 46,
        "start": 240.72,
        "end": 242.88,
        "frames": [
            "frame_00153.png"
        ],
        "transcript": "It is the reason, it is the cause."
    },
    {
        "id": 47,
        "start": 242.88,
        "end": 247.76,
        "frames": [
            "frame_00154.png",
            "frame_00155.png",
            "frame_00156.png",
            "frame_00157.png"
        ],
        "transcript": "It gives me why a body will begin or stop to rotate."
    },
    {
        "id": 48,
        "start": 247.76,
        "end": 260.24,
        "frames": [
            "frame_00158.png",
            "frame_00159.png",
            "frame_00160.png",
            "frame_00161.png",
            "frame_00162.png"
        ],
        "transcript": "The other name for it, also known, also known, it is also known as the moment of force."
