        "frames": [
            "frame_00202.png",
            "frame_00203.png",
            "frame_00204.png"
        ],
        "transcript": "This m is nothing but the mass, is nothing but the mass of the body or the inertia of the body."
    },
    {
        "id": 62,
        "start": 338.96,
        "end": 348.0,
        "frames": [
            "frame_00205.png",
            "frame_00206.png",
            "frame_00207.png"
        ],
        "transcript": "This A is nothing but the acceleration that it has, dv by dt, linear acceleration that it has."
    },
    {
        "id": 63,
        "start": 348.0,
        "end": 352.4,
        "frames": [
            "frame_00208.png",
            "frame_00209.png"
        ],
        "transcript": "So this is the force, this is the mass, this is the acceleration."
    },
    {
        "id": 64,
        "start": 352.4,
        "end": 369.04,
        "frames": [
            "frame_00210.png",
