            "frame_00212.png",
            "frame_00213.png",
            "frame_00214.png",
            "frame_00215.png",
            "frame_00216.png",
            "frame_00217.png",
            "frame_00218.png",
            "frame_00219.png"
        ],
        "transcript": "Now, same way what happens is imagine, imagine you have some random body again and it is uh and it is associated with an axis that means it can rotate about this particular axis."
    },
