        "id": 66,
        "start": 378.32,
        "end": 387.84,
        "frames": [
            "frame_00225.png",
            "frame_00226.png",
            "frame_00227.png",
            "frame_00228.png",
            "frame_00229.png"
        ],
        "transcript": "Then imagine that the body begins to rotate like a fan being turned on, or you turn off the fan slowly, it stops its rotation."
