            "frame_00233.png",
            "frame_00234.png",
            "frame_00235.png",
            "frame_00236.png",
            "frame_00237.png"
        ],
        "transcript": "So it begins to rotate and then it has some kind of then it has some kind of angular acceleration, it has some kind of angular acceleration."
