            "frame_00246.png",
            "frame_00247.png",
            "frame_00248.png",
            "frame_00249.png"
        ],
        "transcript": "And if you multiply that angular acceleration with I, just like you multiplied acceleration with mass, just like you multiplied acceleration with mass, here you multiply angular acceleration with the term moment of inertia, not just inertia, moment of inertia, moment of inertia."
